00:23:45.210 --> 00:24:24.460
<v Beau O'reilly>Eddie set up outside The Palace, smiling and silent at first, and he offered his own newsletter, The Beast of Revelation. A passionate, journalistic banner that proclaims the beauty of the human body. The penis is glorious and the vagina is magical. They have to be seen to be believed argued The Beast of Revelations. And after Eddie had figured most of us, the hippie community of The Palace, had a grasp of his basic message, Eddie came in off the sidewalk and he began to talk to us.
<v Beau O'reilly>埃迪起初在“宫殿”外微笑而沉默，他分发自己的通讯小册子《启示录之兽》。那是一份激情澎湃、充满新闻色彩的横幅，宣扬人体之美。“阴茎是光辉的，阴道是神奇的。”《启示录之兽》辩称，“必须亲眼看见才能相信。”在埃迪觉得我们——“宫殿”的嬉皮士社区——大部分人都理解了他的基本信息后，埃迪从人行道走进来，开始与我们交谈。

00:24:24.460 --> 00:24:37.320
<v Beau O'reilly>He was a public speaker. Could he speak there? Eddie we had a voice and his eyes were wide awake and the title of this first talk was, "Nudity. Nudity Now."
<v Beau O'reilly>他是一位演说家。他能在那儿发言吗？埃迪有声音，他的眼睛瞪得很大，这第一次演讲的标题是：“裸体。现在就裸体。”

00:24:37.320 --> 00:24:59.230
<v Beau O'reilly>He quoted liberally from the D.H Lawrence's Women in Love. Lawrence is big. Oh, he's big. Nudity and orgasm equals freedom. That's what D.H Lawrence sees. And Lawrence sees me, Eddie. Lawrence agrees with Collins. Nudity, sexuality, they form a square knot of human perfection.
<v Beau O'reilly>他大量引用了D.H.劳伦斯的《恋爱中的女人》。劳伦斯是伟大的。哦，他是伟大的。裸体加高潮等于自由。这就是D.H.劳伦斯看到的。而劳伦斯看到了我，埃迪。劳伦斯同意柯林斯的观点。裸体、性，它们构成了人类完美的死结。

00:24:59.230 --> 00:25:16.550
<v Beau O'reilly>Until the Catholic church and public education get ahold of you. Oh, they'll twist you and they'll shame you. And that's bad. It's bad. Read Lawrence. He knows. He's big. Nudity. Nudity now.
